---
/** An emphasised sentence lifted out of the text. */
---

<blockquote class="pull-quote"><slot /></blockquote>

<style>
  .pull-quote {
    margin-inline: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--cat-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .pull-quote :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
